# AI SaaS Starter Kit — Core Rules

## Stack

- Monorepo: Turborepo (`apps/web`, `apps/api`, `packages/*`)
- Web: Next.js 15 App Router (`apps/web`, port 3000)
- API: NestJS (`apps/api`, port 3001)
- DB: Prisma + PostgreSQL (`packages/db/schema.prisma`)
- Shared: `packages/shared` (types, plan limits, error codes)

## Architecture

- Five bounded contexts: `auth`, `organization`, `billing`, `ai`, `user`
- Each module: `domain/` → `application/` → `infrastructure/` → `presentation/`
- Domain layer must NOT import Prisma, HTTP, or external SDKs
- One use case per file in `application/use-cases/`

## Multi-tenancy (required)

- Every tenant query MUST filter by `organizationId`
- Use `TenantGuard` + `@CurrentOrg()` on protected routes
- Never return cross-tenant data

## API responses

```typescript
// Success: { data, meta? }
// Error: { error: { code, message, statusCode } }
```

